Error [jet.StackedRuleLines]: `#Inline` is already applied to this function
  --> tests/ui/marker_repeated_on_one_target.jet:3:11
    |
  3 | #[Inline, Inline] price: fn(cents: Int) -> Int { return cents * 3 }
    |           ^^^^^^
  --> tests/ui/marker_repeated_on_one_target.jet:3:3
    |
  3 | #[Inline, Inline] price: fn(cents: Int) -> Int { return cents * 3 }
    |   ^^^^^^ first application span
 Why: `#Inline` is not a repeatable rule, so the second copy adds nothing and can only disagree with the first
 Fix: Remove the repeated marker
second application span: the copy this report points at
first application span: the earlier copy on the same target
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0999
